(A) The binary slot gas: 2^8 = 256 states of the eight slots (six headings in Port
    order, two rest slots), the table's forward map restricted to them.
  states 256, moving 202, fixed 54
  the map is a bijection of the 256 (checked) and keeps the class (the crowd mask,
  the number of singles n, the vector sum S of their headings) of every state (checked):
  n and S_x, S_y, S_z are conserved at every Node, hence on every line of Nodes
  along an axis a the sum of S_a is conserved by the flight and the table together
  (a unit with p_a != 0 moves along its own line and never leaves it).
  The parity of the rest count is conserved (checked on the 256): a gas born on the
  headings holds its rest units in pairs at every Node, never one alone.
  the head-on pair's cycle: +x -x -> ha hb -> +z -z -> +y -y -> ...
  the unit's assignment (`collide`, nature_beam.py): the k-th single in slot order
  goes to the k-th occupied slot of the image, so +x -> ha -> +z -> +y -> +x: a
  head-on meeting turns the pair's axis x -> z -> y -> x, one axis per two intervals.

(B) The invariant measure. A product measure over the slots with the weight
    w(s) = exp(-eta n(s) - q . S(s)), n counting every unit, gives every state of one
    class the same weight; the table permutes the class, so the measure is unchanged
    by the collision at every Node, exactly, for every (eta, q): the Fermi-Dirac family
    f_i = 1 / (1 + exp(eta + q . c_i)) on the headings; and on the law's sector the rest
    PAIR at f_p = 1 / (1 + exp(2 eta)) = d^2 / (d^2 + (1 - d)^2), d = 1 / (1 + exp(eta)).
    (Semi-detailed balance holds trivially: the map is a permutation of each class.)

(C) The momentum flux tensor Pi_ab = sum_i c_ia c_ib f_i to second order in the
    velocity u (lattice units: one Link per step on a heading). Derived in 25.5:
    Pi_ab = delta_ab [2 d + g(d) rho u_a^2] + O(u^4) at a fixed eta (d = F(eta) the heading's
    rest density, rho = 6 d + 2 d_p, g(d) = rho (1 - 2 d) / (4 d (1 - d))); in terms of the
    local density, delta_ab [P(rho) + g rho (u_a^2 - c_s^2 u^2)]; Pi_ab = 0 off the
    diagonal for EVERY state (the headings are axis-aligned). Checked at d = 1/4 (eta = ln 3):
  eps 0.01: |u| 0.00266, residual of Pi_aa 1.939e-11 (the O(u^4) term), off-diagonal 0.0e+00
  eps 0.005: |u| 0.00133, residual of Pi_aa 1.212e-12 (the O(u^4) term), off-diagonal 0.0e+00
  d = 1/4: d_p = 1/10, rho = 17/10, g = 1.133333 = 17/15

(D) The linearized collision operator A_ij = d Delta_i / d f_j at the equilibrium at
    rest (the Boltzmann level: the product measure over the model's groups at every
    Node). Left null vectors: the mass (the units per group) and the momentum c_a;
    right null vectors: the tangents of the equilibrium family (checked). The
    relaxing modes span the annihilator of the conserved functionals; A on it as a
    block B, with its eigenvalues (decimal check).
