(F) The tagged unit on the law's sector: from a heading, the other five headings
    each held with probability d and the rest pair with d_p; from a rest slot, its
    partner present with certainty (the pair) and the headings at d. The new slot by
    the table's rule (the k-th single in slot order to the k-th occupied slot of the
    image). Transition matrix T_ij(d) on the eight slots; the equilibrium occupation
    (d per heading, d_p per rest slot) is stationary (checked). The diffusion tensor
    D_ab = c^2 [C_0^ab / 2 + sum_{k >= 1} (C_k^ab + C_k^ba) / 2], C_k^ab = <e_a(0) e_b(k)>.
